witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:source_review21-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"dnm_t20_wc6","source_quote":"　　封延伯字仲璉，渤海人也。有學行，不與世人交，事寡嫂甚謹。州辟主簿，舉秀才，不就。後乃仕。垣崇祖爲豫州，啟太祖用爲長史，帶梁郡太守。以疾自免，僑居東海，遂不至京師。三世同財，爲北州所宗附。豫章王辟中兵，不就，卒。","reading":"封延伯自早辭州舉至任長史、帶梁郡、免病及後卒。三世同財為本家事。","note":"封延伯自早辭州舉至任長史、帶梁郡、免病及後卒。三世同財為本家事。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p021","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":107,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:source_review22-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"dnm_t20_wc6","source_quote":"　　建元三年，大使巡行天下，義興陳玄子四世一百七十口同居。武陵郡邵榮興、文獻叔八世同居。東海徐生之、武陵范安祖、李聖伯、范道根五世同居。零陵譚弘寶、衡陽何弘、華陽陽黑頭疏從四世同居，竝共衣食。詔表門閭，蠲租稅。又蜀郡王續祖、華陽郝道福竝累世同爨。建武三年，明帝詔表門閭，蠲調役。","reading":"巡行旌表的同居家戶名單，兩時期各按先後，無另起個人生平。","note":"巡行旌表的同居家戶名單，兩時期各按先後，無另起個人生平。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p022","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":139,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:variant_review22-19","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"dnm_t20_wc6","source_quote":"四世一百七十口同居","reading":"本段是兩次朝廷旌表的群戶名目，依原次全存；所報同居世數與口數各繫原句。","note":"本段是兩次朝廷旌表的群戶名目，依原次全存；所報同居世數與口數各繫原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p022","start_codepoint":19,"end_codepoint":28,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"